  "notes": "{納|おさ}める means to pay, deliver, or offer something to an authority, institution, or proper place.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{税金|ぜいきん}→税金：03308_zeikin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{納|おさ}める: to pay taxes\n- ⟦{会費|かいひ}→会費：08469_kaihi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{納|おさ}める: to pay membership dues\n- ⟦{品物|しなもの}→品物：00886_shinamono⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{納|おさ}める: to deliver goods\n- ⟦{神社|じんじゃ}→神社：01620_jinja⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{納|おさ}める: to offer at a shrine\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{納税|のうぜい}→納税：13806_nouzei⟧: tax payment\n- ⟦{納品|のうひん}→納品：05134_nouhin⟧: delivery of goods\n- ⟦{納入|のうにゅう}→納入：17216_nounyuu⟧: payment, delivery\n- ⟦{納得|なっとく}→納得：03507_nattoku⟧: consent, understanding\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n- {納|おさ}める: to pay, deliver, offer\n- ⟦{治|おさ}める→治める：02462_osameru⟧: to govern, rule, manage\n- ⟦{収|おさ}める→収める：02022_osameru⟧: to obtain, store away\n- ⟦{修|おさ}める→修める：27839_osameru⟧: to study, master",
